# Requirements
# - VSCodeプラグイン REST Client

### シナリオ1 組織ID指定で照会
curl -X GET "http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/user/mst_organization/corpration/detail/auth?&org_id=TEP0001" -H "Content-Type: application/json"
Content-Type: application/json

### シナリオ2 組織ID存在しない
curl -X GET "http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/user/mst_organization/corpration/detail/auth?&org_id=" -H "Content-Type: application/json"
Content-Type: application/json

### シナリオ3 組織権限情報マスタに1件もない
curl -X GET "http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/user/mst_organization/corpration/detail/auth?&org_id=" -H "Content-Type: application/json"
Content-Type: application/json

### シナリオ4 DBアクセス不可
curl -X GET "http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/user/mst_organization/corpration/detail/auth?&org_id=" -H "Content-Type: application/json"
Content-Type: application/json